t","url":"/docs/components/card","content":"Card groups related content, like media, text, and actions, on a single surface. On its own, a Card\nis a static surface, or a link when you pass `href`. Put Cards in a `CardGroup` to make them\nselectable or to give them an action: the group owns selection, row actions, focus, and arrow-key\nnavigation."},"241":{"id":"/docs/components/card-21","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#default","content":"A simple website status message."},"242":{"id":"/docs/components/card-22","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#text-lockup","content":"Introduce the next step in setting up a business website."},"243":{"id":"/docs/components/card-23","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#corner-actions","content":"Save a business guide for later, mark it as read from the menu, or open the guide."},"244":{"id":"/docs/components/card-24","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#link","content":"Link to billing, domain search, or hosting from the whole Card. Keep nested controls out of\nstandalone link Cards."},"245":{"id":"/docs/components/card-25","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#grouped-links","content":"Open a domain's settings by pressing its Card or Enter. Toggle auto-renew or manage DNS without\nopening the Card. Arrow keys move between domains, skipping the domain being transferred."},"246":{"id":"/docs/components/card-26","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#media","content":"Preview website templates with inset, full bleed, or standalone media, and a brand palette\nwith custom media. Direct CornerActions place the favorite action over the template preview."},"247":{"id":"/docs/components/card-27","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"ty